<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We show the statistics of ZeroGR-Train Dataset in the Table <a href="#A4.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix D The ZeroGR-Train Dataset ‣ ZeroGR: A Generalizable and Scalable Framework for Zero-Shot Generative Retrieval" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> and Figure <a href="#A4.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ Appendix D The ZeroGR-Train Dataset ‣ ZeroGR: A Generalizable and Scalable Framework for Zero-Shot Generative Retrieval" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>.</p>
</div>
